{"id":"attentat","lemma":"attentat","pos":"noun","rank":3704,"glosses":["attack, assault (illegal act of violence toward another)"],"ipa":"/a.tɑ̃.ta/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d4/Fr-attentat.ogg/Fr-attentat.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"attentats"},"formAudio":{"attentats":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-attentats.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'était un attentat-suicide.","en":"It was a suicide bombing.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"suicide"}]},{"text":"Où étiez-vous lors de l'attentat ?","en":"Where were you during the attack?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},null,null,{"g":"the / it"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"during, at the time of"]]},{"text":"L'attentat a été déjoué.","en":"The attack was foiled.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"to foil","l":"déjouer"}]},{"text":"Il y a eu un attentat contre le président.","en":"There was an attempt on the president's life.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"against"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"president"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"ago"]]},{"text":"Vous êtes le seul à avoir survécu à l'attentat, n'est-ce pas ?","en":"You're the only one to survive the attack, aren't you?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"alone"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"to survive","l":"survivre"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"not"}]}]}